<title>MEXICO: Mexico 9-mos direct foreign investment $3.0 bln.</title>
<headline>Mexico 9-mos direct foreign investment $3.0 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PUERTO VALLARTA, Mexico 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Direct foreign investment in Mexico from January to September this year was $3.0 billion, a senior official with the Ministry of Trade said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;What we have registered during 1996 is about $3.0 billion,&quot; said the sub-director of international negotiations,  Jaime Zabludovsky. &quot;To the end of September...those are the investments that were made.&quot;</p>
<p>He said that the amount was similar to that seen last year.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559</p>
